        "created_at": "2015-02-06T20:49:22.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>So we played a game of SOTM,</p><p>And we ended up with 6 players so no one would be left out.</p><p>Well one of the people in our group likes to make things interesting, So he decided that Omniton-X Has a Logic/emotion chip &nbsp;malfunction and that he thought we were all in his words “Meat sacks” and decided that He would be a traitor, and help out Gloomweaver. We lucked out and had DW Mr. Fixer and everytime Omni would put an equipment in play, Fixer would destroy that and hit Gloomweaver. It was a very interesting game, like having 2 bad guys.</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:43:40.371Z",
