        "created_at": "2015-02-06T21:10:40.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>So I decited to make up my own rules for him:</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Omnitron-X has suffered a Logic/Emotion chip Failure. (<strong>Omniton-X loses 1 HP</strong>)</p><p>Omniton-X rolls a 6 sided dice and decides what to do.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Roll 1 Or 3: Omniton-X Feels the “Meat Sacks” need to die and will do something sinister.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Roll 2 or 5: Omnitron-X May Choose to help or Hinder the “Meat Sacks”.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Roll 4 or 6: Omnitron-X Must either Help the “Meat Sacks” or help himself.</p>",
        "post_number": 3,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T04:05:54.730Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
