        "raw": "<p>So I decited to make up my own rules for him:</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p align=\"center\">Omnitron-X has suffered a Logic/Emotion chip Failure. (<strong>Omniton-X loses 1 HP</strong>)</p><p align=\"center\">Omniton-X rolls a 6 sided dice and decides what to do.</p><p align=\"center\">&nbsp;</p><p align=\"center\">Roll 1 Or 3: Omniton-X Feels the &ldquo;Meat Sacks&rdquo; need to die and will do something sinister.</p><p align=\"center\">&nbsp;</p><p align=\"center\">Roll 2 or 5: Omnitron-X May Choose to help or Hinder the &ldquo;Meat Sacks&rdquo;.</p><p align=\"center\">&nbsp;</p><p align=\"center\">Roll 4 or 6: Omnitron-X Must either Help the &ldquo;Meat Sacks&rdquo; or help himself.</p>",
